event-line Apollo 11
// stress: dense-dates — every card below the spine, so the spine dots are the first ink (#2117)
side below

tag Phase as p
  Launch red
  Transit blue
  Landing green
  Return purple

// `side below` stacks every card on one side (`side above` for the top). Two
// events share 1969-07-16 — the dots stay coincident (they ARE simultaneous),
// the cards fan into stacked lanes, and the shared date label is drawn once.

1969-07-16 Liftoff  p: Launch
  Saturn V departs Kennedy Space Center at 13:32 UTC.

1969-07-16 Translunar Injection  p: Transit
  The stack leaves Earth orbit three hours after launch.

1969-07-19 Lunar Orbit  p: Transit
  Insertion behind the Moon after a three-day coast.

1969-07-20 Touchdown  p: Landing
  **Eagle** lands at Tranquility Base with seconds of fuel to spare.

1969-07-24 Splashdown  p: Return
  Pacific recovery; the crew returns after eight days.
